#! console --size 120x34
# The gear opens Settings beside the chat: the session's live options, then a defaults tab.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
key alt-,
wait-frame 5000 Settings
snap session
key right
wait-frame 5000 Thinking
snap models
key right
key right
key right
key right
key right
key right
wait-frame 5000 menu for the pane
snap keys
quit
